{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2019-11-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'KARO PHARMA AB (PUBL) ANNOUNCES TERMINATION OF PROJECT REGARDING ROR-GAMMA', 'text': 'IN DECEMBER 2011, KARO PHARMA AKTIEBOLAG ENTERED INTO A RESEARCH COLLABORATION AND LICENSE AGREEMENT WITH PFIZER, WITH THE PURPOSE OF DISCOVERING AND DEVELOPING SUBSTANCES THAT HAMPER THE ACTIVITY IN THE NUCLEAR HORMONE RECEPTOR ROR-GAMMA, FOR TREATMENT OF AUTOIMMUNE DISEASES. AFTER COMPLETION OF THE INITIAL RESEARCH COLLABORATION, PFIZER HAS CONDUCTED THE DEVELOPMENT WORK IN-HOUSE, IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT. PFIZER HAS INFORMED KARO PHARMA ABOUT ITS DECISION TO TERMINATE THE SPECIFIC DEVELOPMENT PROJECT, PF-06763809. AS A RESULT, KARO PHARMA WILL NOT RECEIVE FURTHER DEVELOPMENT AND SALES MILESTONES RELATED TO THE PROJECT. IN MAY 2018 KARO PHARMA COMMUNICATED THEORETICAL MILESTONES OF UP TO USD 200 MILLION. THE TERMINATION OF THE PROJECT HAS NO IMPACT ON THE RUNNING OPERATIONS NOR THE BUSINESS OUTLOOK.'}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2019-11-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'PFIZER INC. PRESENTS AT 12TH ANNUAL SCRIPTMED® CONFERENCE, NOV-04-2019', 'text': 'PFIZER INC. PRESENTS AT 12TH ANNUAL SCRIPTMED® CONFERENCE, NOV-04-2019 . VENUE: THE MIAMI BEACH EDITION, MIAMI BEACH, FLORIDA, UNITED STATES.'}